@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:9999
@token = test-token-placeholder

### 创建：正常
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/member-tags
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: tag-create-demo-001

{
  "name": "高意向用户",
  "color": "orange",
  "description": null
}

### 边界：空名称，应返回 400 INVALID_ARGUMENT
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/member-tags
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: tag-create-demo-002

{
  "name": "   ",
  "color": "orange"
}

### 冲突：重复名称，应返回 409 NAME_CONFLICT
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/member-tags
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: tag-create-demo-003

{
  "name": "高意向用户",
  "color": "blue"
}

### 查询与分页
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/member-tags?page_size=20&cursor=next-demo
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
